  "content": "<p>這是為<span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/xenomustache\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">XenoMustache</a></span>所製作的<em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iron-furnaces\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron Furnaces</a></em>模組設計的資源包。它將升級熔爐的材質改為框架結構，而非完全由單一材質方塊構成。</p><p>下方為對比圖：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2a3ec870-23c5-4b0a-b35a-c70a752d558e.png\"></p>",
